SUMMARY:Roving Rhythm Crew by Junkyard Beats
DESCRIPTION:Join the Roving Rhythm Crew in The Corner these school holidays
  for high energy rhythm and fun. Performed by Junkyard Beats and presented
  by QPAC\, this crew of mischief makers weave between audiences using recy
 cled instruments\, body percussion\, physical theatre\, and cheeky improvi
 sation to turn any space into a stage.See more of Junkyard Beats in their 
 award-winning performance The Box Show\, showing at QPAC from 30 Sep to 3 
 Oct 2026. This project has been assisted by the Australian Government thro
 ugh Creative Australia\, its principal arts investment and advisory body.
LOCATION:State Library of Queensland\, Stanley Place\, South Bank
URL:https://www.slq.qld.gov.au/whats-on/roving-rhythm-crew-junkyard-beats
